theorem k215UnpairAt1681CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt1681State k215PNum1681 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt1681State k215PNum1681 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt1681Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt1681Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt1681Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt1681ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt1681Reach16))));
