pub theorem k215UnpairMacro1681 (n a b c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt1681State k215PNum1681 a b n c) (k215UnpairAt1681State k215PNum1689 (fst ((a, b) + n)) (snd ((a, b) + n)) 0 c) $ =
